# The Settler's warrant journal: local state, never committed.
.warrant/

# verdicts/ IS version-controlled, deliberately: it is the hosting of the verdict
# documents, served by raw.githubusercontent.com at the URI inscribed onchain. Do
# not ignore it, do not reformat it. Only the temporary files of the atomic write
# (writeAtomic: <file>.<pid>.tmp) are excluded, because a crash at the wrong
# moment leaves one behind.
verdicts/*.tmp
verdicts/batch/*.tmp
